{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suika Idle</strong> is a unique incremental game where you easily and simply merge fruits, make juice, and run a caf\u00e9 while dreaming of creating the world's best juice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf49 <strong>Merge Fruits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine two of the same fruit to create a bigger one and earn more money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge small fruits into larger ones to increase your profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Merge2.gif?t=1740644300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd64 <strong>Make Juice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Put fruits into a cup to make delicious juice!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can display the juice on the counter and sell it to customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better the fruit you use, the more expensive the juice will be\u2014so aim to make the best juice possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Juice2.gif?t=1740644300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience various stories alongside the character, who dreams of making the world's best juice! Watch as they grow and improve through their efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Story_EN.gif?t=1740644300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1 <strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To expand your caf\u00e9, upgrades are essential!</strong> <br>Increase fruit income, juice prices, and more to boost your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep upgrading, and the day you create the world's best juice won\u2019t be far away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Upgrade.jpg?t=1740644300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b50 Prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to gain special abilities, try <strong>Prestige!</strong> <br>Prestige unlocks powerful new features with stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss the chance to grow even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Prestige.jpg?t=1740644300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf80 <strong>Decorate Your Caf\u00e9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your caf\u00e9 with stylish decorations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorations aren\u2019t just for looks\u2014they also provide useful effects to help run your caf\u00e9. Design a fantastic caf\u00e9 and boost your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/extras/Decoration.jpg?t=1740644300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The challenge to create the world's best juice starts now!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436990?t=1740644300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436990?t=1740644300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/120720b16ba199f640254b0f1e6b0558648fefa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740644300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436990/120720b16ba199f640254b0f1e6b0558648fefa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740644300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":nu